# dealt on its controller's turn. On turn 3 Bot1's Bite Down has the Greatwurm deal 7 damage to one of Bot2's Grizzly Bears (CR 120.2,
# not combat damage): no counter. On turn 4 it blocks the other Bear, dealing 7 combat damage during Bot2's turn: none either. On turn 5 it
# attacks and deals the same amount of combat damage during Bot1's own turn: seven counters.

